    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223030/extras/869f891c85873587186c8832f0b65b44.avif?t=1733991664\" /></div><br><br>Our planet is at the edge of the global disaster, all living things are about to vanish.<br>Lives and livelihoods are shattered, the world has become more dangerous.<br>We play as the girl named Ami. She heads to a certain place that gives hope to survive. Yet, before she reaches it there are lots of challenges to take<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223030/extras/94f8eebf4e61b820a8760f3f1d2ffed2.poster.avif?t=1733991664\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223030/extras/94f8eebf4e61b820a8760f3f1d2ffed2.webm?t=1733991664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223030/extras/94f8eebf4e61b820a8760f3f1d2ffed2.mp4?t=1733991664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br>* Pleasant minimalist visual style to the atmosphere of the withering world<br>* Focus on the character and object animation to show that the world is still alive<br>* Silent story that is told through interaction with the environment, backgrounds and characters animation<br>* Interesting puzzles to interact with the world and make gameplay more diverse<br>* Sound design and music with love to every detail, makes you get the right mood<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223030/extras/25ea71719d4427c575efa99fbc4109c3.poster.avif?t=1733991664\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223030/extras/25ea71719d4427c575efa99fbc4109c3.webm?t=1733991664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223030/extras/25ea71719d4427c575efa99fbc4109c3.mp4?t=1733991664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223030/extras/869f891c85873587186c8832f0b65b44.avif?t=1733991664\" /></div><br><br>Our planet is at the edge of the global disaster, all living things are about to vanish.<br>Lives and livelihoods are shattered, the world has become more dangerous.<br>We play as the girl named Ami. She heads to a certain place that gives hope to survive. Yet, before she reaches it there are lots of challenges to take<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223030/extras/94f8eebf4e61b820a8760f3f1d2ffed2.poster.avif?t=1733991664\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223030/extras/94f8eebf4e61b820a8760f3f1d2ffed2.webm?t=1733991664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223030/extras/94f8eebf4e61b820a8760f3f1d2ffed2.mp4?t=1733991664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br>* Pleasant minimalist visual style to the atmosphere of the withering world<br>* Focus on the character and object animation to show that the world is still alive<br>* Silent story that is told through interaction with the environment, backgrounds and characters animation<br>* Interesting puzzles to interact with the world and make gameplay more diverse<br>* Sound design and music with love to every detail, makes you get the right mood<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223030/extras/25ea71719d4427c575efa99fbc4109c3.poster.avif?t=1733991664\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223030/extras/25ea71719d4427c575efa99fbc4109c3.webm?t=1733991664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223030/extras/25ea71719d4427c575efa99fbc4109c3.mp4?t=1733991664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
